      ],
      "behavior": "Exact Help/debug/gui action freezes the current ordered tree, files and importer options/logs, asynchronously commits/loads a private immutable Store snapshot, removes its slot, then forcibly closes the current pages without a question and reconstructs fresh page and importer identities. Actual Qt first-root/first-child selection and empty-thumbnail-selection reset are retained. Closed original pages remain undoable with original queues paused; restored queues start fresh and retain captured settings/logs. Later edits/new pages cannot alter the admitted snapshot. Hidden new requests are refused but admitted work delivers while Main is hidden. Weak Main/Pages and weak timer callbacks, permanent binding retirement and shared final-Bound-clone lease reject late completions after accepted exit/rebind/final-clone/Main destruction; Exit Cancel preserves admitted work.",
